                <p>Not printed, but see footnote 58, <ref target="#pg864">p. 864</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d585-f2" n="69" xml:id="d585-f2-content">
                <p>Sir Maurice Drummond Peterson.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
